@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #EAF2FA
skinparam activityBorderColor #365A7C
skinparam activityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFF3D6
skinparam activityDiamondBorderColor #94732C
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #F4F6F8
skinparam noteBorderColor #A4AFBA
skinparam ArrowColor #43576B
skinparam dpi 140

title Order fulfillment\nSimplified activity diagram

start
:Request inventory allocation;
:Wait for assignment or cancellation request;
if (Cancellation requested?) then (yes)
  :Cancel order in Ordering;\nFinish: ORDER_CANCELLED;
  stop
else (no)
  :Release Shipment to WMS;
endif
:Wait for Shipment outcome\nor cancellation request;
if (Cancellation requested\nand Shipment not yet terminal?) then (yes)
  :Request Shipment cancellation;
  note right
    Accepted: wait for cancellation or handover.
    Rejected: continue waiting for handover.
    The Activity reply alone is not a terminal fact.
  end note
else (no)
endif
:Wait for Shipment terminal Signal;
if (Shipment outcome?) then (cancelled)
  :Cancel order in Ordering;\nFinish: ORDER_CANCELLED;
  stop
else (handed over)
  :Complete outbound inventory movements;
  :Record order fulfillment;\nFinish: FULFILLMENT_COMPLETED;
  stop
endif

legend bottom
  Cancellation Updates record intent; the main flow performs the work.
  In-flight Activities must return before cancellation can proceed.
  Ordering must confirm cancellation before ORDER_CANCELLED.
  Inventory release after cancellation continues asynchronously.

  Failure paths omitted: contradictory facts or Ordering rejection fail the Workflow.
  Activities use the configured retry policy; non-retryable failures fail the Workflow.
endlegend
@enduml
